<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">SquareRoot</indexterm></keywords>
</metadata>
</prolog>
<refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody ">
<section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">The SquareRoot is available in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Math</uicontrol> folder of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">kitControl</apiname> palette.</p></section>
